vidya-symbols.ttf is a glyph subset of DejaVu Sans.

DejaVu fonts are based on the Bitstream Vera fonts, with additional
characters. License (summary): free to use, modify, and redistribute;
must not use Bitstream/DejaVu names to endorse derived works without
permission. Full text: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html

Generated with fonttools pyftsubset for UI punctuation/symbols plus
common math-in-prose Unicode (Greek, letterlike ℕℤℚℝℂ, superscripts/
subscripts, mathematical operators, general punctuation spaces, and
mathematical alphanumeric forms). Rebuild:
`scripts/rebuild-symbols-ttf.sh`.

